<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charSet="utf-8" data-next-head=""/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" data-next-head=""/><title data-next-head="">ADX Investor Relations Guide</title><link rel="icon" href="https://www.adx.ae/favicon.ico" data-next-head=""/><meta name="keywords" content="" data-next-head=""/><meta name="description" content="A Strategic Framework for Listed Companies in Line with Global Best Practices" data-next-head=""/><meta property="og:title" content="" data-next-head=""/><meta property="og:description" content="" data-next-head=""/><meta property="og:image" content="undefined" data-next-head=""/><meta property="og:url" content="" data-next-head=""/><script type="text/javascript" src="/ruxitagentjs_ICA7NVfhqrux_10345260810170330.js" data-dtconfig="rid=RID_1818345838|rpid=-1308363908|domain=adx.ae|reportUrl=/rb_c78abecb-792d-4f48-92c7-975c88614b35|app=ada3130d51886d7f|owasp=1|featureHash=ICA7NVfhqrux|rdnt=1|uxrgce=1|cuc=6irk2c8n|mel=100000|expw=1|dpvc=1|md=mdcc1=a#header-top ^rb div ^rb div:nth-child(1) ^rb div ^rb div:nth-child(5) ^rb div ^rb div ^rb div ^rb div ^rb div ^rb li ^rb a ^rb h3|lastModification=1790204261899|tp=500,50,0|srbbv=2|agentUri=/ruxitagentjs_ICA7NVfhqrux_10345260810170330.js"></script><link rel="preload" href="/-/media/adx/topnavigation/adx-logo/adx-white-logo.svg" as="image" data-next-head=""/><link rel="preload" href="/-/media/adx/topnavigation/adx-logo/adx-dark-logo.svg" as="image" data-next-head=""/><link data-next-font="size-adjust" rel="preconnect" href="/" crossorigin="anonymous"/><link rel="preload" href="https://www.adx.ae/_next/static/css/b4d896e6f289cf5b.css" as="style"/><link rel="preload" href="https://www.adx.ae/_next/static/css/13446ce890d994f1.css" as="style"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://www.adx.ae/_next/static/css/b4d896e6f289cf5b.css" data-n-g=""/><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://www.adx.ae/_next/static/css/13446ce890d994f1.css" data-n-p=""/><noscript data-n-css=""></no